# AI WAVE FM (aiwavefm.ru)  — https://aiwavefm.ru/api/get_tracks.php
# AIRFM (airfm.net)         — https://airfm.net/tracks.json
# airadio.dev               — https://airadio.dev/api/library/{genre}/{subgenre}
# Genesia (genesiai.ru)     — синхронный эфир по mp3-файлам
# AetherWave                — https://aetherwavestudio.com/api/radio/stations/{shareCode}/now-playing
